abstract: >-
  Research implementation of compact policy-surrogate packets, bounded
  empirical grounding, and native recipient absorption in finite symbolic
  Convention Relay tasks. Includes historical evidence and reproducibility
  tooling. This software release is not a peer-reviewed publication or a
  demonstration of unrestricted ontology discovery.
keywords:
